Subject: [PATCH 188/244] Update session handling to correctly inject messages
 into active chats

Introduce `getActiveSessionKey` to dynamically resolve the correct session key from `sessions.json` at inject time, fixing issues with stale session mappings and ensuring messages are sent to the active webchat session. Update control UI script versions.

